  "description": "On the day he dumps his cheating ex, salaryman Taeyoon Han meets two gorgeous guys: friendly coffee shop owner Yehan and stubborn businessman Jaehyuk. The two couldn’t be more different, but one thing’s for certain: they both want to please Taeyoon in bed. Drunk and craving affection, Taeyoon gives in to his desires… which ends in a one-night-stand threesome! Taeyoon is sure it’s a one-time mistake, but wait! Yehan and Jaehyuk want to continue the threesome?! So begins not one, not two… but three times the fun in bed. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
